ative with respect to calendar time (negative for long options as time decay erodes optionality). Under BSM the gamma-theta-vega identity from the PDE links them algebraically.","tags":["derivatives","vega-theta"],"title":"Vega and Theta"},"is_retracted":false,"new_card_hash":"8e530fc18679caa4f814739522b3501382017c0fb6d14ea307ab9f3556736902","prev_card_hash":null,"prev_checksum":null,"schema_version":"cacg.v0","seq":0,"timestamp":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
